&_nc_oc=AdpOgmJTbmkTaYBwh0Hp9lew8Jyk6knbySSLcmbN57087z3ArXS8d5sB3R9-tK78MVM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-GaoVLOQzLMvlH7Qn4x_BlBOf2f2H6GLc-dxTADCqaSg&oe=6A3BF4BE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=07qEnVsUBr0Q7kNvwGtnn34&_nc_oc=Adq7TYvdgIZfsLEP-lb18X3z3YZn2YgNW_dX-8FfbxGPlSKLfmc1c1iMcwOvHHyj0IM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9FKL_7RMFC8VvePgTLHkGjn3F8lmd02SfMT896y-ASkA&oe=6A3BCD7C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vgGmDdQ-oIEQ7kNvwFKXSgf&_nc_oc=Adr6gZxGC7Dldbsb-NMHBoFfSh6S_yqesaOJ5MYjr8hlDaRiDcZK3oQX-xUovExj2cc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_dyQIMXm3iKUzHtCWGyzzsAMLP6t0o_fPE_6akEK4f0w&oe=6A3BEC07"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-C3JhJTUu6UQ7kNvwHRlIHa&_nc_oc=AdoBA8inunRweBO-eDb1yqGXbBjHZ6xXbrcKOoSsFZWXDILaFe1ZIhkUImCJh7hyo3Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af805v_esaVpvefFaEhpGi_iegOsiQhs8_Dr_wsSoy6Low&oe=6A3BD7D5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5KIWVaqUOpMQ7kNvwH8ghY2&_nc_oc=AdqE2Xdl96xef3EW_i2mlpfE_3vNZxKYDmcYOps7UqTi0DMqCO93dIZSUPubeeV3Z4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9mL8oohKqI5Y0iFo6bXL5v_X1aJe0a4---ZGOlM2oMsQ&oe=6A3BE464"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.